# Conformance probe pack for malformed input on the `protobuf` wire
# (spec/vector-format.md, "Malformed input"). Public. No kinds. One field of
# each wire type and one inside a submessage, so the vectors cut a varint, a
# fixed64, a fixed32, a length-delimited field and a submessage. One packed
# list of varints (field 6), so a vector cuts a varint inside a packed field.
format   conformance-malformed-protobuf
version  0.1.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md and spec/vector-format.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses     probe
wire     protobuf
field    uid       1    pstring
field    time_ms   2    pvarint
field    lat       3    pdouble
field    callsign  4.1  pstring
field    ce        5    pfloat
group    probe.nums  6
  field  probe.val  .  pvarint
end
